OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe variable amounts of cloud this
OL,7,Fevening and overnight with passing
OL,8,Fshowers, perhaps some longer spells of
OL,9,Frain across Shetland at first. Fresh
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA few bright spells but often
OL,13,Fcloudy with a few passing showers.
OL,14,FBrisk westerly winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRather
OL,17,Fcloudy with a chance of showers on
OL,18,FSaturday. Drier with sunny spells on
OL,19,FSunday. Dry and bright on Monday.
